# JustAC local pin: upstream ships no SimulationCraft list for this spec. Discipline's
# damage priority between heals (Atonement turns this damage into healing): Shadow Word:
# Pain upkeep first (Expiation consumes it, Power of the Dark Side procs from it), the
# Shadow Word: Death execute, then Mind Blast and Penance on cooldown, Void Blast while a
# Voidweaver's Entropic Rift is open, Holy Nova as a Lightburst nuke or a 3+ target spender,
# and Smite as filler. Healing cooldowns, ramps (Radiance, Evangelism, Ultimate Penitence)
# and shields are left to the healer. In 12.1 Shadowfiend, Mindbender and Voidwraith are
# passive summons (Shadow Word: Death, Evangelism, Entropic Rift), Purge the Wicked is a
# passive upgrade of Shadow Word: Pain, and Halo / Divine Star are not in the Discipline
# tree, so none of them appear. Grounded against client build 12.1.0.69875.

# Shadow Word: Death below 20% is the execute (+150% damage, Death's Torment repeats,
# Shadowfiend proc chance), so it goes ahead of Mind Blast.
actions=shadow_word_pain,if=refreshable
actions+=/shadow_word_death,if=target.health.pct<20
# Mind Blast opens Entropic Rift for Voidweaver; Penance spreads Shadow Word: Pain
# (Encroaching Shadows) and spends the Power of the Dark Side empowerment.
actions+=/mind_blast
actions+=/penance
# Smite becomes Void Blast only while Entropic Rift is up (Darkening Horizon extends the rift).
actions+=/void_blast,if=hero_tree.voidweaver
# Lightburst makes Holy Nova a 30 sec cooldown nuke worth pressing on one target (12 yd).
actions+=/holy_nova,if=talent.lightburst
actions+=/holy_nova,if=active_enemies>=3
actions+=/smite
